  "bodyHtml": "<section class=\"studio-intro studio-section\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Software ecodesign</p>\n                            <h2>Drive your approach by measuring frugality</h2>\n                            <p>Awareness, training, best practices: essential, but not enough.\n                                With Greenspector Studio, objectively measure the frugality of your digital\n                                product.</p>\n                            <p>At each step, base your decisions on reliable, complete and objective measurements,\n                                as well as rigorous impact assessment.</p>\n                            <p>Add concrete KPIs (carbon impact, ecoscore, performance, data) to your\n                                management dashboards.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Greenspector-Studio-Ecoscore-r3tmosfu8yqrw3ak5b8noo6ypd23wbpp1qnna0qh14_fdbe25f9.png\" alt=\"Ecoscore Greenspector Studio\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Project KPIs</p>\n                            <h2>New indicators to drive improvement</h2>\n                            <p><strong>Deceptively simple, the Greenspector ecoscore is based on a complete analysis</strong>\n                                of all user journey steps on three axes, taking into account whether\n                                measured steps are critical or not.</p>\n                            <p><strong>The ecoscore is representative of the real frugality level of your journey</strong>\n                                and comes with detailed environmental indicators, such as carbon impact.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"../mesure-impact-environnemental-numerique/\">Learn more about\n                                    impacts (methodology, indicators...)</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Concrete results</p>\n                        <h2>From commitment of means to certainty of results</h2>\n                        <p>Your team is trained, aware and applies best practices. That is an excellent\n                            foundation. But what is the real quality of the product delivered?</p>\n                        <p>Greenspector Studio lets you verify whether your application truly meets your\n                            frugality, performance and impact objectives.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Energie-par-etape-r63byp63s0kjum3ot2ueiqc9paw1fjflobxqd6n4jc_7e2fbfe9.png\" alt=\"Battery discharge and energy score by journey step\">\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Interface_Droits-r65ddx7ma6xzz6o88mkf4q1me6s0qeuhr2m7evibaw_4581fef3.png\" alt=\"Rights and access management in Greenspector Studio\">\n                            </figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Collaboration</p>\n                        <h2>Work as a team with the right level of detail</h2>\n                        <p>Each role has its indicators and level of detail. Through rights\n                            management, share your analyses and bring all teams into a results-driven\n                            approach.</p>\n                        <figure class=\"studio-figure\">\n                            <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/evolution-r41o1fvo92cqjsiy7yt7o2e2r6pln13h7djzozv2d4_4627dddb.png\" alt=\"Tracking ecoscore trends over time\">\n                        </figure>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-highlight\">\n                        <div class=\"studio-copy\">\n                            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Continuous improvement</p>\n                            <h2>Measure before each release</h2>\n                            <p><strong>Run a measurement at each release to detect anomalies and track\n                                    indicator trends.</strong></p>\n                            <p>Trigger tests via API from your CI/CD (GitLab CI, Azure DevOps, Jenkins...) and\n                                export results to your internal dashboards.</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"../devgreenops/\">Learn more about continuous integration</a></p>\n                            <p class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-gs-primary\" href=\"../../contact/\">Request a\n                                        free demo</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section studio-quote-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">What they say</p>\n                        <blockquote class=\"studio-quote\">\n                            <p>It was important for us to quantify and objectify the concrete impact of\n                                ecodesign efforts. Thanks to the Greenspector ecoscore, we were able to\n                                rationally assess the results of our efforts before and after the project.</p>\n                            <p>Greenspector provides a tool to track the evolution of best\n                                practices and identify adjustments needed to go further in\n                                frugality.</p>\n                            <footer>\n                                <img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/CSmeyers-150x150_1e5f8ccb.jpg\" alt=\"Portrait of Caroline Smeyers\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <strong>Caroline Smeyers</strong>\n                                    <span>Web Manager, Bruxelles Environnement / Leefmilieu Brussels</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </footer>\n                        </blockquote>\n                        <p class=\"studio-footnote\"><em>Certaines fonctionnalités décrites peuvent ne pas être\n                                disponibles selon le niveau d'abonnement. Please see our <a href=\"../../tarifs-greenspector-studio/\">Pricing</a>.</em></p>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standards</p>\n                        <h2>Compatible with leading standards</h2>\n                        <div class=\"studio-grid studio-mini-grid\">\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Recognition</h3>\n                                <p>Solution recognised for its contribution to protecting the environment.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>R&amp;D</h3>\n                                <p>Innovations from research presented at international\n                                    conferences.</p>\n                            </article>\n                            <article class=\"studio-card studio-card-compact\">\n                                <h3>Standards compatibility</h3>\n                                <p>LCA (ISO 14040), Green Software Foundation SCI, ADEME RCP and related standards.</p>\n                            </article>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <section class=\"studio-section\">\n                        <p class=\"eyebrow\">References</p>\n                        <h2>They use Greenspector Studio</h2>\n                        <p>To combine environmental responsibility, user satisfaction and application\n                            performance.</p>\n                        <div class=\"studio-logo-grid\">\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_sncfconnect_04f4832d.jpg\" alt=\"SNCF Connect logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_cats_8cc5042d.jpg\" alt=\"CATS logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo_AirFrance_616731c4.webp\" alt=\"Air France logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/logo-bouygues-telecom_889990d1.svg\" alt=\"Bouygues Telecom logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_orange_338b842b.jpg\" alt=\"Orange logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/Logo-France-televisions-300x157_e988d666.jpg\" alt=\"France Télévisions logo\"></figure>\n                            <figure class=\"studio-logo-card\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/external/greenspector.com/client_regionbretagne_b8829f76.jpg\" alt=\"Région Bretagne logo\"></figure>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>"
